[I] Library for the connection tracking timeout infrastructure

[T] libnetfilter_cttimeout is the userspace library for the Netfilter
[T] cttimeout infrastructure. It allows defining fine-grained connection
[T] tracking timeout policies per flow and sending them to the kernel via
[T] ctnetlink.

[U] https://www.netfilter.org/projects/libnetfilter_cttimeout/

